# GS-016: More liquid can retain more CO2 at the same headspace size
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 20mL
seal v1 100mL
add v1 CO2 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 200mL
seal v2 100mL
add v2 CO2 0.001mol
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
